{'symbol': 'FICO', 'date': '2022-06-06 08:00:00', 'title': 'FICO JOINS NAWBO ADVOCACY DAYS TO HIGHLIGHT THE IMPORTANCE OF CREDIT EDUCATION FOR WOMEN BUSINESS OWNERS', 'text': 'SAN JOSE, CALIF.--(BUSINESS WIRE)---- $FICO--AS PART OF ITS “SCORE A BETTER FUTURE” FINANCIAL EDUCATION PROGRAM, LEADING APPLIED ANALYTICS COMPANY FICO (NYSE:FICO) WILL BE PARTICIPATING IN THE 2022 NATIONAL ASSOCIATION OF WOMEN BUSINESS OWNERS (NAWBO) ADVOCACY DAYS ON JUNE 8, 2022. SPECIAL GUEST CONGRESSWOMAN CLAUDIA TENNEY (NY-22) WILL JOIN KAREN BENNETTS, FOUNDER OF LITTLE RED BIRD AND THE INCOMING CHAIR AT NAWBO, TO PROVIDE INTRODUCTORY REMARKS PRIOR TO THE FICO-HOSTED PANEL ON CREDIT EDUCATION. BENNE'}